  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Compounds that contain at least one benzene ring in their structure are called benzenoid compounds.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0199_2ed5f6169bb1.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 173px;\" /></p><p>The above compounds are benzenoid compounds due to the presence of benzene ring.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\ot2_0199_9a0a18f327ea.png\" style=\"width: 100px; height: 100px;\" />Cycloocta-1,3,5,7-tetraene&nbsp;is non aromatic beacause of its tub shaped structure.</p><p>&nbsp;</p></blockquote>"
